  "changes": [
    "Retain raw computed transform and scale declarations while deriving used applicability from the original box role.",
    "Preserve eligible replaced, atomic and blockified boxes across float/position layout clones and parentless flex/grid recovery.",
    "Use the same applicability for paint, stacking, containing blocks, pagination and PDF form fallback.",
    "Suppress stale placement-slot links when floated or interrupted root anchors already own their effected fragments; preserve inherited-anchor fallback.",
    "Share complete legacy orientation/clamp display context between normal layout and ancestor recovery."
  ],
